# Double subtraction of exactly representable values

Subtracts 1.5 from 2.25 to verify native double-precision subtraction for
values exactly representable in f64, producing 0.75.

>>> source
double_left: double = 2.25
double_right: double = 1.5

double_diff: double = double_left - double_right
print(double_diff)

<<< stdout
0.75

<<< stderr
